stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle: User has no active container
  Idle --> Provisioning: acquireSandboxLease() CAS
  Provisioning --> Ready: Daytona container boots & ports ready
  Ready --> ActiveTurn: Bot executing commands / VNC stream open
  ActiveTurn --> GracePeriod: Turn completes; delayed 5m shutdown scheduled
  GracePeriod --> ActiveTurn: New message arrives before 5m (extend lease)
  GracePeriod --> Stopping: 5m timer expires OR user clicks "Stop My Sandbox"
  Stopping --> Idle: Daytona confirms container stopped; CAS lease cleared
  Ready --> Stopping: 1m Cron detects lease expiration (rescue)
